00:06:38.260 --> 00:06:40.588
But no, it's all the team.

00:06:40.588 --> 00:06:41.380
PAUL YOUNG: Thanks.

00:06:41.380 --> 00:06:42.692
And Timo?

00:06:42.692 --> 00:06:45.240
TIMO SALZSIEDER: Yeah,
